{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>In that day I will strike every horse</b> — of the nations of the land." "<b>And upon the house of Judah</b> — who went with them against their will: I will open My eyes to watch over them and to deliver them." "<b>And the horse of the peoples</b> — not the horse of the Jews, for he would be in the camp: I will strike with blindness, and behold immediately he will stumble in his horse."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:51.414625114Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}